     "type": "text",
     "text": "got a $40 parking ticket on campus, perry st lot, 10/21 at 7:52pm. my grad permit was displayed but the officer said it was \"not visible\" because it was on the dash flat and the sun visor was down?? the lot is permit-free after 7pm anyway i think. help me write an appeal, short",
